<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Servgro shareholders approve unbundling.</title>
<headline>Servgro shareholders approve unbundling.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders in South African industrial group Servgro International Ltd on Thursday approved the firm's unbundling plans, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>In February Servgro said it would unbundle its assets in two phases which could result in the liquidation and delisting of Servgro during the second half of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
